  "description": "Traditional aesthetics with modern design and affordances define the Kink Feral frame. Built with trails or park riding in mind, it can also handle street just as well for riders seeking something more traditional and stable. The mellower headtube angle keeps the front end solid, while the 13.5-13.75” chainstay length allows for adjustability and a longer wheelbase for added stability. The small toptube diameter, tapered seatstays and chainstays, and their domed end caps give the frame its clean and traditional look. The large custom-designed CNC seatstay and chainstay bridges not only look great but also provide extra stiffness to the rear triangle. The frame comes standard with an integrated seatpost clamp, integrated chain tensioners, and removable brake lugs for those looking to run brakes (brake mount kit sold separately).\n\nHeadtube and Gussets\n\nFeaturing full gussets both top and bottom and a new custom brass headtube badge.\n\nSeatstay Bridge\n\nOversized laser cut seatstay bridge for even more stiffness.\n\nDropout and Tensioners\n\nLaser cut dropouts with all new custom domed seatstay and chainstay caps.",
